{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303051","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303051","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430305101:1":{"text":"사람들이 누가 셀로클랜드를 지키고 있는 지 자주 잊어버리기 때문이지요.","source_cn":"因为总有人忘记是谁在守护着萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6801DC1897F63418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430305102:1":{"text":"온갖 방법으로, 온 힘을 다해 에세일의 여왕님을 모독하려는 자들입니다.","source_cn":"他们想方设法，费尽心力去污蔑艾塞勒的女王。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC749819EC45A8710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430305103:1":{"text":"그러니 저희 제사장들은 고통으로 그 에세일들의 기억을 되살려야 하지요.","source_cn":"我们祭司便是要以疼痛唤醒这些艾塞勒的记忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3446CE3FDCB956F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭司奥黛":{"text":"제사장 오델","source":"祭司奥黛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}